# Generated Facadeur workspace

This project runs independently of the Facadeur editor repository.

```sh
pnpm install
pnpm storybook
pnpm typecheck
pnpm build
```

`packages/ui` contains React components and shared schema types.
`apps/storybook` previews those components with generated example data.
If generated with `--next-example`, `pnpm next` starts the Next.js demo in `apps/next`.

Regenerating updates managed files and removes stale generated files. Keep custom code in additional files; edits to managed files are overwritten. Dependencies and lockfiles are retained between runs.
